/strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</fieldset>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\"><strong><input id=\"submit\" name=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Submit\" /></strong></p>\r\n</form>\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":[],"decisions":[{"id":"pseudo:relationship-to-the-child","on":true,"label":"Make a bold line a real heading","why":"\"Relationship to the child\" is a paragraph in bold type. It reads as a heading and is spaced like one, but it is not in the page's outline, a screen reader does not announce it, and the contents list cannot link to it.","value":"h2"},{"id":"blockhead","on":true,"label":"Turn the headings into section headers","why":"1 heading is plain text where every other page uses a section header, so the page reads as one continuous wall instead of parts.","value":"1 section"},{"id":"balance","on":true,"label":"Give the cards the width their content needs","why":"4 rows hold two cards of very different weight in equal halves, and cards in a row are the same height — so the short one is stretched and the difference shows as empty space. 7.1× — 311 characters beside 44. Only the column widths change.","value":"4 rows"},{"id":"jumbotron","on":true,"label":"Jumbotron callouts become notes","why":"1 callout is built as a Bootstrap jumbotron, which the component list replaced with dc-note and which Bootstrap itself removed in version 5. Same content, the site's own callout.","value":"1 callout"},{"id":"colhead","on":true,"label":"Stop a column label claiming to be a section","why":"1 section header sits inside a grid column rather than across the page — so a row of three labels claims three sections where there is one, and each turns up in the banner's contents list as somewhere to jump to. They become sub-headings of the section the row is in, with the same mark a heading inside any other component gets. No word changes, and an anchor an author wrote by hand moves onto the heading with it.","value":"1 header"},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"Child Development Services (CDS)\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /cds."}],"mechanical":["empty paragraphs removed: 2","inline layout styles stripped: 3","hard spaces used as an indent removed: 1","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 15","empty divs removed: 1","line breaks at the edge of a block removed: 3"],"findings":[{"name":"empty-paragraph","n":2,"eg":["(empty)","(empty)"]}],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/cds/childfindform","title":"Child Development Services - Child Find Intake Form","changed":"2026-04-06T22:48:42+00:00","words":396,"bytes":20381,"fixes":["empty paragraphs removed: 2","inline layout styles stripped: 3","hard spaces used as an indent removed: 1","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 15","empty divs removed: 1","line breaks at the edge of a block removed: 3"],"flags":["no section-header device","legacy jumbotron","inline style= remains"],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[],"outline":[],"components":{"cards":0,"cardHeaders":0,"cardTitles":0,"accordions":0,"tables":0,"dataTables":0,"contactCube":0,"jumbotron":1,"dcNote":0,"blockheads":0,"videos":0,"images":0,"buttons":0},"access":{"imagesNoAlt":0,"vagueLinkText":[],"emptyLinks":0,"tablesNoScope":0,"multipleH1":0,"inlineColour":1},"links":{"internal":[],"files":[],"external":[],"mailto":[],"safelinks":[],"anchors":[]},"age":{"changed":"2026-04-06T22:48:42+00:00","yearsMentioned":[],"newestYear":null,"yearsBehind":null,"schoolYears":[],"unfinishedPhrases":[]},"opening":null,"openingChars":0},"override":{}}